<title>JAPAN: BOJ governor to attend diet committee on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>BOJ governor to attend diet committee on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will attend a parliamentary committee meeting on Wednesday from 10 a.m. (0100 GMT) to noon (0300 GMT), the BOJ said in a statement.</p>
<p>He will answer questions from Yoshio Suzuki, a former BOJ economist and now a Lower House member with the key opposition group, the New Frontier Party (Shinshinto).</p>
</text>
